  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_001 (scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest validation accuracy. Uncertainty remains about whether the image encoder (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) or fusion method (concat vs weighted) significantly impacts performance. Testing config_023 (scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, transformer aggregation, concat fusion) isolates these factors while maintaining other top-performing parameters. This comparison clarifies the relative importance of image encoder choice and fusion strategy, balancing exploration of critical design decisions with exploitation of proven components."
